### Feature 2.1.1 - Searching Balance (svccode HP00001 / opcode HPOP001)
### IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client format.
### Requires kopa.middleware-ktrn running on :8082 and Postgres reachable per application.yaml.
@host = http://localhost:8081/kopa-customer-self-care

### 1. Search balance for a subscriber (ispCd omitted - middleware applies its configured default)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/balance/0771000050

### 2. Search balance, explicit ispCd (matches the API doc's worked example)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/balance/0771000050?ispCd=62

### 3. Invalid msisdn -> expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{host}}/api/v1/balance/abc

### 4. Swagger UI / OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
